# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to solve the Market Split problem using [Kipu"
" Quantum's Iskay quantum optimizer](/guides/kipu-optimization) "
"[\\[1\\]](#references). The Market Split problem represents a real-world "
"resource allocation challenge where markets must be partitioned into "
"balanced sales regions to meet exact demand targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinakikita ng tutorial na ito kung paano lutasin ang Market Split problem "
"gamit ang [Iskay quantum optimizer ng Kipu Quantum](/guides/kipu-"
"optimization) [\\[1\\]](#references). Ang Market Split problem ay "
"kumakatawan sa isang real-world resource allocation challenge kung saan "
"kailangang hatiin ang mga market sa balanseng sales regions upang matugunan "
"ang eksaktong demand targets.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The Market Split challenge {#the-market-split-challenge}"
msgstr "Ang Market Split challenge {#the-market-split-challenge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Market Split problem presents a deceptively simple yet computationally "
"formidable challenge in resource allocation. Consider a company with $m$ "
"products being sold across $n$ different markets, where each market "
"purchases a specific bundle of products (represented by the columns of "
"matrix $A$). The business objective is to partition these markets into two "
"balanced sales regions such that each region receives exactly half the total"
" demand for every product.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Market Split problem ay nagpapakita ng isang mukhang simpleng ngunit "
"computationally formidable na hamon sa resource allocation. Isaalang-alang "
"ang isang kumpanya na may $m$ na mga produkto na ibinebenta sa $n$ na iba't "
"ibang markets, kung saan bawat market ay bumibili ng isang partikular na "
"bundle ng mga produkto (kinakatawan ng mga column ng matrix $A$). Ang "
"layuning pang-negosyo ay hatiin ang mga market na ito sa dalawang balanseng "
"sales regions na ang bawat region ay makakatanggap ng eksaktong kalahati ng "
"kabuuang demand para sa bawat produkto.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Mathematical formulation:**\n"
msgstr "**Pormulasyong matematikal:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We seek a binary assignment vector $x$, where:\n"
"- $x_j = 1$ assigns market $j$ to Region A\n"
"- $x_j = 0$ assigns market $j$ to Region B\n"
"- The constraint $Ax = b$ must be satisfied, where $b$ represents the target sales (typically half the total demand per product)\n"
msgstr ""
"Hinahanap natin ang isang binary assignment vector $x$, kung saan:\n"
"- Ang $x_j = 1$ ay nagtatalaga ng market $j$ sa Region A\n"
"- Ang $x_j = 0$ ay nagtatalaga ng market $j$ sa Region B\n"
"- Ang constraint na $Ax = b$ ay dapat matugunan, kung saan ang $b$ ay kumakatawan sa target sales (karaniwang kalahati ng kabuuang demand bawat produkto)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Cost function:**\n"
msgstr "**Cost function:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To solve this problem, we minimize the squared constraint violation:\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang lutasin ang problemang ito, pinaliit natin ang squared constraint "
"violation:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left(\\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij}x_j - "
"b_i\\right)^2$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left(\\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij}x_j - "
"b_i\\right)^2$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where:\n"
"- $A_{ij}$ represents the sales of product $i$ in market $j$\n"
"- $x_j \\in \\{0,1\\}$ is the binary assignment of market $j$\n"
"- $b_i$ is the target sales for product $i$ in each region\n"
"- The cost equals zero precisely when all constraints are satisfied\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan:\n"
"- Ang $A_{ij}$ ay kumakatawan sa mga benta ng produkto $i$ sa market $j$\n"
"- Ang $x_j \\in \\{0,1\\}$ ay ang binary assignment ng market $j$\n"
"- Ang $b_i$ ay ang target sales para sa produkto $i$ sa bawat region\n"
"- Ang cost ay katumbas ng zero sa tuwing natutugunan ang lahat ng constraints\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each term in the sum represents the squared deviation from the target sales "
"for a particular product. When we expand this cost function, we get:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bawat term sa sum ay kumakatawan sa squared deviation mula sa target sales "
"para sa isang partikular na produkto. Kapag pinalawak natin ang cost "
"function na ito, nakukuha natin ang:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$C(x) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"
msgstr "$$C(x) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since $b^T b$ is a constant, minimizing $C(x)$ is equivalent to minimizing "
"the quadratic function $x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x$, which is exactly a QUBO "
"(Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization) problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dahil ang $b^T b$ ay constant, ang pagpapaliit ng $C(x)$ ay katumbas ng "
"pagpapaliit ng quadratic function na $x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x$, na eksaktong "
"isang QUBO (Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization) problem.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Computational complexity:**\n"
msgstr "**Computational complexity:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Despite its straightforward business interpretation, this problem exhibits remarkable computational intractability:\n"
"- **Small-scale failure**: Conventional Mixed Integer Programming solvers fail on instances with as few as seven products under a timeout of one hour [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"
"- **Exponential growth**: The solution space grows exponentially ($2^n$ possible assignments), making brute force approaches infeasible\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa kabila ng straightforward na interpretasyong pang-negosyo nito, ang problemang ito ay nagpapakita ng kapansin-pansing computational intractability:\n"
"- **Small-scale failure**: Ang conventional Mixed Integer Programming solvers ay nabibigo sa mga instance na may kasing kaunti ng pitong produkto sa ilalim ng timeout na isang oras [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"
"- **Exponential growth**: Ang solution space ay lumalaki nang exponential ($2^n$ na posibleng assignments), na ginagawang hindi posible ang brute force approaches\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This severe computational barrier, combined with its practical relevance to "
"territory planning and resource allocation, makes the Market Split problem "
"an ideal benchmark for quantum optimization algorithms "
"[\\[4\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang matinding computational barrier na ito, kasama ng praktikal na kaugnayan"
" nito sa territory planning at resource allocation, ay ginagawang ideal "
"benchmark para sa quantum optimization algorithms ang Market Split problem "
"[\\[4\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What makes Iskay's approach unique? {#what-makes-iskays-approach-unique}"
msgstr ""
"Ano ang gumagawang natatangi sa approach ng Iskay? {#what-makes-iskays-"
"approach-unique}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Iskay optimizer uses the **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized counterdiabatic"
" quantum optimization)** algorithm [\\[1\\]](#references), which represents "
"a significant advancement in quantum optimization:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ginagamit ng Iskay optimizer ang **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized "
"counterdiabatic quantum optimization)** algorithm [\\[1\\]](#references), na"
" kumakatawan sa isang makabuluhang advancement sa quantum optimization:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Circuit efficiency**: The bf-DCQO algorithm achieves remarkable gate reduction [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- Up to **10 times fewer entangling gates** than Digital Quantum Annealing (DQA)\n"
"- Significantly shallower circuits enable:\n"
"  - Less error accumulation during quantum execution\n"
"  - Ability to tackle larger problems on current quantum hardware\n"
"  - No need for error mitigation techniques\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kahusayan ng circuit**: Ang bf-DCQO algorithm ay nakakamit ng kahanga-hangang gate reduction [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- Hanggang **10 beses na mas kaunting entangling gates** kaysa Digital Quantum Annealing (DQA)\n"
"- Ang makabuluhang mas mababaw na circuits ay nagbibigay-daan sa:\n"
"  - Mas kaunting error accumulation sa panahon ng quantum execution\n"
"  - Kakayahang harapin ang mas malalaking problema sa kasalukuyang quantum hardware\n"
"  - Walang pangangailangan para sa error mitigation techniques\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Non-variational design**: Unlike variational algorithms requiring approximately 100 iterations, bf-DCQO typically needs only **approximately 10 iterations** [\\[1\\]](#references). This is achieved through:\n"
"- Intelligent bias-field calculations from measured state distributions\n"
"- Starting each iteration from an energy state near the previous solution\n"
"- Integrated classical post-processing with local search\n"
msgstr ""
"**Non-variational design**: Hindi tulad ng variational algorithms na nangangailangan ng mga humigit-kumulang 100 iterations, ang bf-DCQO ay karaniwang nangangailangan lamang ng **mga humigit-kumulang 10 iterations** [\\[1\\]](#references). Nakakamit ito sa pamamagitan ng:\n"
"- Matalinong bias-field calculations mula sa sinusukat na state distributions\n"
"- Pagsisimula ng bawat iteration mula sa energy state na malapit sa nakaraang solusyon\n"
"- Integrated classical post-processing na may local search\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Counterdiabatic protocols**: The algorithm incorporates counterdiabatic "
"terms that suppress unwanted quantum excitations during short evolution "
"times, enabling the system to remain near the ground state even with rapid "
"transitions [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Counterdiabatic protocols**: Isinasama ng algorithm ang mga "
"counterdiabatic terms na nagsusupil ng mga hindi gustong quantum excitations"
" sa panahon ng maikling evolution times, na nagbibigay-daan sa system na "
"manatiling malapit sa ground state kahit na may mabilis na transitions "
"[\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

