#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The power of quantum optimization lies in transforming constrained problems "
"into unconstrained quadratic forms [\\[4\\]](#references). For the Market "
"Split problem, we convert the equality constraints\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kapangyarihan ng quantum optimization ay nakasalalay sa pagtransporma ng"
" constrained problems sa unconstrained quadratic forms "
"[\\[4\\]](#references). Para sa Market Split problem, kinukumberte natin ang"
" equality constraints\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$ Ax = b $$\n"
msgstr "$$ Ax = b $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where $x ∈ \\{0,1\\}^n$, into a QUBO by penalizing constraint violations.\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang $x ∈ \\{0,1\\}^n$, sa isang QUBO sa pamamagitan ng pagpaparusa"
" sa constraint violations.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The penalty method:**\n"
"Since we need $Ax = b$ to hold exactly, we minimize the squared violation:\n"
"$$f(x) = ||Ax - b||^2$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ang penalty method:**\n"
"Dahil kailangan nating ang $Ax = b$ ay manatiling eksaktong totoo, pinaliit natin ang squared violation:\n"
"$$f(x) = ||Ax - b||^2$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This equals zero precisely when all constraints are satisfied. Expanding algebraically:\n"
"$$f(x) = (Ax - b)^T(Ax - b) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Ito ay katumbas ng zero sa tuwing natutugunan ang lahat ng constraints. Sa pag-expand nang algebraically:\n"
"$$f(x) = (Ax - b)^T(Ax - b) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**QUBO objective:**\n"
"Since $b^T b$ is constant, our optimization becomes:\n"
"$$\\text{minimize} \\quad Q(x) = x^T(A^T A)x - 2(A^T b)^T x$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**QUBO objective:**\n"
"Dahil ang $b^T b$ ay constant, ang ating optimization ay nagiging:\n"
"$$\\text{minimize} \\quad Q(x) = x^T(A^T A)x - 2(A^T b)^T x$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Key insight:** This transformation is exact, not approximate. Equality "
"constraints naturally square into quadratic form without requiring auxiliary"
" variables or penalty parameters - making this formulation mathematically "
"elegant and computationally efficient for quantum solvers "
"[\\[4\\]](#references). We'll use the `OptimizationProblem` class to define "
"our constrained problem, then convert it to QUBO format using "
"`OptimizationProblemToQubo`, both from the **qiskit_addon_opt_mapper** "
"package. This automatically handles the penalty-based transformation.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pangunahing insight:** Ang transformation na ito ay eksaktong, hindi "
"tinantiya. Ang equality constraints ay natural na nag-square sa quadratic "
"form nang hindi nangangailangan ng auxiliary variables o penalty parameters "
"- ginagawang mathematically elegant at computationally efficient para sa "
"quantum solvers ang pormulasiyon na ito [\\[4\\]](#references). Gagamitin "
"natin ang `OptimizationProblem` class upang tukuyin ang ating constrained "
"problem, pagkatapos ay i-convert ito sa QUBO format gamit ang "
"`OptimizationProblemToQubo`, pareho mula sa **qiskit_addon_opt_mapper** "
"package. Ito ay awtomatikong humahawak ng penalty-based transformation.\n"

