"- **`solution_info`**: Detalyadong impormasyon kasama ang:\n"
"  - `bitstring`: Ang optimal assignment bilang binary string\n"
"  - `cost`: Ang objective function value (dapat ay 0 para sa perpektong constraint satisfaction)\n"
"  - `mapping`: Kung paano nag-map ang bitstring positions sa problem variables\n"
"  - `seed_transpiler`: Seed na ginamit para sa reproducibility\n"
"- **`prob_type`**: Kung ang solusyon ay nasa binary o spin format\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Let's examine the solution returned by the quantum optimizer.\n"
msgstr "Suriin natin ang solusyon na ibinalik ng quantum optimizer.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Solution validation {#solution-validation}"
msgstr "Pagpapatunay ng solusyon {#solution-validation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we validate whether the quantum solution satisfies the Market Split "
"constraints. The validation process checks:\n"
msgstr ""
"I-validate natin ngayon kung natutugunan ng quantum solution ang Market "
"Split constraints. Sinusuri ng validation process ang:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**What is a constraint violation?**\n"
"- For each product $i$, we calculate the actual sales in Region A: $(Ax)_i$\n"
"- We compare this to the target sales $b_i$\n"
"- The **violation** is the absolute difference: $|(Ax)_i - b_i|$\n"
"- A **feasible solution** has zero violations for all products\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ano ang constraint violation?**\n"
"- Para sa bawat produkto $i$, kinakalkula natin ang aktwal na benta sa Region A: $(Ax)_i$\n"
"- Inihahambing natin ito sa target sales na $b_i$\n"
"- Ang **violation** ay ang absolute difference: $|(Ax)_i - b_i|$\n"
"- Ang **feasible solution** ay may zero violations para sa lahat ng produkto\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**What we expect:**\n"
"- **Ideal case**: Total violation = 0 (all constraints perfectly satisfied)\n"
"  - Region A gets exactly 1002 units of Product 1, 879 units of Product 2, and 1040 units of Product 3\n"
"  - Region B gets the remaining units (also 1002, 879, and 1040 respectively)\n"
"- **Good case**: Total violation is small (near-optimal solution)\n"
"- **Poor case**: Large violations indicate the solution doesn't satisfy the business requirements\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ano ang inaasahan natin:**\n"
"- **Ideal case**: Kabuuang violation = 0 (lahat ng constraints ay perpektong natutugunan)\n"
"  - Ang Region A ay nakakakuha ng eksaktong 1002 units ng Product 1, 879 units ng Product 2, at 1040 units ng Product 3\n"
"  - Ang Region B ay nakakakuha ng natitirang units (gayundin 1002, 879, at 1040 ayon sa pagkakabanggit)\n"
"- **Good case**: Ang kabuuang violation ay maliit (near-optimal solution)\n"
"- **Poor case**: Ang malalaking violations ay nagpapahiwatig na ang solusyon ay hindi natutugunan ang mga pangangailangan ng negosyo\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The validation function will compute:\n"
"1. Actual sales per product in each region\n"
"2. Constraint violations for each product\n"
"3. Market distribution between regions\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang validation function ay magsasagawa ng:\n"
"1. Aktwal na benta bawat produkto sa bawat region\n"
"2. Mga constraint violations para sa bawat produkto\n"
"3. Pamamahagi ng market sa pagitan ng mga regions\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Interpret the validation results {#interpret-the-validation-results}"
msgstr ""
"Bigyang-kahulugan ang mga validation results {#interpret-the-validation-"
"results}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The validation results show whether the Quantum Optimizer found a feasible "
"solution. Let's examine the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng validation results kung nakakita ang Quantum Optimizer ng "
"feasible solution. Suriin natin ang sumusunod:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Feasibility check:**\n"
"- **`is_feasible = True`** means the solution perfectly satisfies all constraints (total violation = 0)\n"
"- **`is_feasible = False`** means some constraints are violated\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pagsusuri sa feasibility:**\n"
"- Ang **`is_feasible = True`** ay nangangahulugang perpektong natutugunan ng solusyon ang lahat ng constraints (kabuuang violation = 0)\n"
"- Ang **`is_feasible = False`** ay nangangahulugang may ilang constraints na nilabag\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Sales analysis:**\n"
"- Compare Target versus Actual sales for each product\n"
"- For a perfect solution: Actual = Target for all products in both regions\n"
"- The difference indicates how close we are to the desired market split\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pagsusuri ng benta:**\n"
"- Ihambing ang Target versus Actual sales para sa bawat produkto\n"
"- Para sa perpektong solusyon: Actual = Target para sa lahat ng produkto sa parehong regions\n"
"- Ipinapakita ng pagkakaiba kung gaano tayo kalapit sa nais na market split\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Market distribution:**\n"
"- Shows how many markets are assigned to each region\n"
"- There's no requirement for equal numbers of markets, only that sales targets are met\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pamamahagi ng market:**\n"
"- Ipinapakita kung gaano karaming markets ang nakatakda sa bawat region\n"
"- Walang kinakailangan para sa pantay na bilang ng markets, basta natutugunan lamang ang sales targets\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Solution quality assessment {#solution-quality-assessment}"
msgstr "Pagsusuri sa kalidad ng solusyon {#solution-quality-assessment}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Based on the validation results above, we can assess the quality of the "
"quantum solution:\n"
msgstr ""
"Batay sa validation results sa itaas, masusuri natin ang kalidad ng quantum "
"solution:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If `is_feasible = True` (Total violation = 0):**\n"
"- The Quantum Optimizer successfully found an optimal solution\n"
"- All business constraints are perfectly satisfied\n"
"- This demonstrates quantum advantage on a problem where classical solvers struggle [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kung `is_feasible = True` (Kabuuang violation = 0):**\n"
"- Matagumpay na nakakita ang Quantum Optimizer ng optimal solution\n"
"- Lahat ng business constraints ay perpektong natutugunan\n"
"- Ipinakikita nito ang quantum advantage sa isang problema kung saan nahihirapan ang classical solvers [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If `is_feasible = False` (Total violation > 0):**\n"
"- The solution is near-optimal but not perfect\n"
"- Small violations may be acceptable in practice\n"
"- Consider adjusting optimizer parameters:\n"
"  - Increase `num_iterations` for more optimization passes\n"
"  - Increase `postprocessing_level` for more classical refinement\n"
"  - Increase `shots` for better measurement statistics\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kung `is_feasible = False` (Kabuuang violation > 0):**\n"
"- Ang solusyon ay near-optimal ngunit hindi perpekto\n"
"- Maaaring tanggapin ang maliliit na violations sa praktis\n"
"- Isaalang-alang ang pag-adjust ng optimizer parameters:\n"
"  - Itaas ang `num_iterations` para sa mas maraming optimization passes\n"
"  - Itaas ang `postprocessing_level` para sa mas maraming classical refinement\n"
"  - Itaas ang `shots` para sa mas magandang measurement statistics\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Cost function interpretation:**\n"
"- The `cost` value from `solution_info` equals $||Ax - b||^2$\n"
"- Cost = 0 indicates perfect constraint satisfaction\n"
"- Higher cost values indicate larger constraint violations\n"
msgstr ""
"**Interpretasyon ng cost function:**\n"
"- Ang `cost` value mula sa `solution_info` ay katumbas ng $||Ax - b||^2$\n"
"- Ang Cost = 0 ay nagpapahiwatig ng perpektong constraint satisfaction\n"
"- Ang mas mataas na cost values ay nagpapahiwatig ng mas malalaking constraint violations\n"

