msgid ""
"**Loaded a real optimization problem**: Obtained a challenging Market Split "
"instance from the QOBLIB benchmark library [2]\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nag-load ng real optimization problem**: Nakakuha ng mahirap na Market "
"Split instance mula sa QOBLIB benchmark library [2]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Transformed to QUBO format**: Converted the constrained problem into an "
"unconstrained quadratic formulation [3]\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nagtransporma sa QUBO format**: Kinumberte ang constrained problem sa "
"unconstrained quadratic formulation [3]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Leveraged advanced quantum algorithms**: Used Kipu Quantum's bf-DCQO "
"algorithm with counterdiabatic terms [1]\n"
msgstr ""
"**Gumamit ng advanced quantum algorithms**: Ginamit ang bf-DCQO algorithm ng"
" Kipu Quantum na may counterdiabatic terms [1]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Obtained optimal solutions**: Found feasible solutions satisfying all "
"constraints\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nakakuha ng optimal solutions**: Nakakita ng feasible solutions na "
"natututugunan ang lahat ng constraints\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Mga pangunahing aral {#key-takeaways}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Algorithm innovation**: The bf-DCQO algorithm represents a significant advancement [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- **10 times fewer gates** than digital quantum annealing\n"
"- **Approximately 10 iterations** instead of approximately 100 for variational methods\n"
"- **Built-in error resilience** through circuit efficiency\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pagbabago sa algorithm**: Ang bf-DCQO algorithm ay kumakatawan sa makabuluhang advancement [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- **10 beses na mas kaunting gates** kaysa digital quantum annealing\n"
"- **Humigit-kumulang 10 iterations** sa halip na humigit-kumulang 100 para sa variational methods\n"
"- **Built-in error resilience** sa pamamagitan ng kahusayan ng circuit\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Counterdiabatic terms**: Enable rapid quantum evolution while maintaining "
"ground state fidelity, making quantum optimization practical on today's "
"noisy hardware [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Counterdiabatic terms**: Nagbibigay-daan sa mabilis na quantum evolution "
"habang pinapanatili ang ground state fidelity, na ginagawang praktikal ang "
"quantum optimization sa maingay na hardware ngayon [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Bias-field guidance**: The iterative bias-field approach allows each "
"iteration to start near previously found good solutions, providing a form of"
" quantum-enhanced local search [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Bias-field guidance**: Ang iterative bias-field approach ay nagbibigay-"
"daan sa bawat iteration na magsimula malapit sa dati nang natagpuang "
"magagandang solusyon, na nagbibigay ng isang uri ng quantum-enhanced local "
"search [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

